{
 "title": "原子变量与 Mutex",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "当多个线程访问同一块内存时，不能发生数据竞争。对于单个数字，最简单的解决办法是**原子**变量：操作是不可分割的。`AtomicI64.fetch_and_add(n)` 做加法，`load()` 读取。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "import std.thread",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    counter = thread.AtomicI64.new(0)",
    "    counter.fetch_and_add(10)",
    "    counter.fetch_and_add(5)",
    "    print(\"counter:\", counter.load())",
    "    print(counter.compare_and_swap(15, 100), counter.load())"
   ],
   "run": false,
   "local": true
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "对更复杂的数据，使用 **`Mutex`**：用 `lock()` 获取，用 `unlock()` 释放。一种不会忘记解锁、更安全的方式是 **`Locked[T]`**，它把值放进锁里面：`lock()` 返回一个 `Guard`，当 `Guard` 离开作用域时锁会自动释放。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "import std.thread",
    "",
    "fn work(c: Arc[thread.Locked[i64]]):",
    "    for _i in 0..1000:",
    "        g = c.value.lock()",
    "        g.value() += 1",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    counter = Arc[thread.Locked[i64]](thread.Locked[i64].new(0))",
    "    workers = List[thread.Thread]()",
    "    for w in 0..4:",
    "        c = counter.clone()",
    "        workers.push(thread.Thread.spawn(fn() =>",
    "            work(c)))",
    "    for i in 0..workers.len:",
    "        workers[i].join()",
    "    print(counter.value.get())"
   ],
   "run": false,
   "local": true
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "`Arc[T]` 是带计数的共享，让多个线程拥有同一个值：`clone()` 增加一个新所有者，最后一个所有者放手时值被释放。"
  },
  {
